WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:06.000
Welcome to DBL Group's TalentHub!
In your unit, candidates who pass the

2
00:00:06.120 --> 00:00:11.640
first interview need your approval
before they go on to the recruiter.

3
00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:16.679
In this video we'll see how to approve
the finalists, how to send CVs to the

4
00:00:16.799 --> 00:00:21.200
recruiter, and how to give marks when
you sit on a panel. Let's get started!

5
00:00:21.550 --> 00:00:27.377
Your job is one thing: the decision.
Approve, Return, or Reject. Approve,

6
00:00:27.497 --> 00:00:32.110
and the candidate becomes Final and the
recruiter books the second interview.

7
00:00:32.460 --> 00:00:36.340
The role is granted per unit,
on Access Control.

8
00:00:36.460 --> 00:00:41.540
If a unit has no Head, this step does not
exist and candidates go straight to Final.

9
00:00:42.340 --> 00:00:47.660
In the menu you have Candidate Approvals,
Requisitions, and My Interviews.

10
00:00:48.010 --> 00:00:51.250
Sign in with your DBL email and password.

11
00:00:51.370 --> 00:00:55.090
Requisitions lists your
unit's posted requisitions,

12
00:00:55.210 --> 00:00:58.530
My Interviews the panels you sit on.

13
00:00:58.650 --> 00:01:03.130
Factory HR's job analysis and the pipeline
are not your job, so they are not there.

14
00:01:03.480 --> 00:01:08.080
Open Candidate Approvals.
Each row is one candidate: name, post,

15
00:01:08.880 --> 00:01:14.240
requisition, CV,
and the average mark, as a percentage.

16
00:01:14.760 --> 00:01:20.760
Beside it, what each panelist recommended:
Select, Reject or Talent Pool.

17
00:01:21.110 --> 00:01:26.430
Click View interview to open the row: the
interview date, the score out of fifty,

18
00:01:26.550 --> 00:01:31.871
and the present and expected salary,
as the HR panelist wrote them.

19
00:01:31.991 --> 00:01:37.670
Click the CV and it opens in a new tab.
Many rows, use the search at the top.

20
00:01:38.020 --> 00:01:42.940
How to read the marks. The average
is the first-interview panel's.

21
00:01:43.060 --> 00:01:47.339
Each panelist's marks are shown
separately, with their recommendation.

22
00:01:47.459 --> 00:01:52.420
Factory HR's Yes means they
say go ahead; you confirm.

23
00:01:52.770 --> 00:01:56.332
Click Approve, the tick.
The candidate is Final,

24
00:01:56.452 --> 00:01:59.970
the recruiter is told,
and the row leaves your list.

25
00:02:00.320 --> 00:02:05.920
Want to know something?
The arrow is Return to Factory HR.

26
00:02:06.040 --> 00:02:11.480
The note is required, then Return.
The candidate goes back to Factory HR,

27
00:02:11.600 --> 00:02:14.560
who answer and resend, or reject.

28
00:02:14.910 --> 00:02:21.390
Reject needs a reason, and the decision
is final. Today I only show it, Cancel.

29
00:02:21.740 --> 00:02:27.140
After a Return, two things can happen.
Factory HR answer and resend,

30
00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:30.900
and the row comes back with their answer.

31
00:02:31.100 --> 00:02:34.620
Or they reject. Either way you are told.

32
00:02:34.970 --> 00:02:39.010
Several at once? Tick the ones you want,

33
00:02:39.130 --> 00:02:43.530
then Approve with the count.
One click, all of them Final.

34
00:02:43.880 --> 00:02:49.680
You can do it without signing in.
When Factory HR sends, you get one email,

35
00:02:49.800 --> 00:02:56.000
just one, with the whole list. The link
opens the same rows, the same buttons,

36
00:02:56.400 --> 00:02:59.950
and Approve all. It lasts fourteen days,
and opening it decides nothing.

37
00:03:00.070 --> 00:03:02.520
One more thing you can do.
Once the job is posted,

38
00:03:02.640 --> 00:03:06.670
Send CVs to the recruiter on
Profile & Posting. Drop in the PDF,

39
00:03:06.790 --> 00:03:13.110
give the source, then Send CV.
It reaches the recruiter under your name.

40
00:03:13.460 --> 00:03:18.327
Below, the list you sent,
and how many times each applied before.

41
00:03:18.447 --> 00:03:24.180
Shortlisting is the recruiter's decision;
you will know who was called.

42
00:03:24.530 --> 00:03:28.010
You are told when someone
awaits your approval,

43
00:03:28.130 --> 00:03:31.781
by email too if Email
notifications is on in Settings.

44
00:03:31.901 --> 00:03:36.450
After a Return, when Factory HR resends,
you are told again.

45
00:03:36.800 --> 00:03:42.440
Questions. Can I change it after
approving? No, one decision only.

46
00:03:42.560 --> 00:03:48.200
In doubt, Return first. And why do
some first interviews never reach me?

47
00:03:48.640 --> 00:03:53.680
Only the ones the recruiter
hands to Factory HR come to you.

48
00:03:54.030 --> 00:03:56.270
And if I am on the panel myself?

49
00:03:56.430 --> 00:04:02.631
Mark under My Interviews;
Role Guide 09 shows the sheet.

50
00:04:03.470 --> 00:04:07.870
When that candidate reaches your approval,
your own marks appear in the row too.

51
00:04:08.220 --> 00:04:12.900
In short. Candidate Approvals,
or the link in the email.

52
00:04:13.180 --> 00:04:18.660
Check the marks, the recommendations,
the salary. Approve, Return with a note,

53
00:04:18.780 --> 00:04:25.020
or Reject with a reason. The full guide
is a PDF under Tutorials. Thank you.

